    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no \"becoming.\" that's the thing. i didn't build a foundation, i built a pedestal. now that the pedestal is gone, there's nothing to stand on. i look in the mirror and i dont see a person, i just see a massive, catastrophic mistake. it feels like the universe is just telling me that my part in the story is done. like there's no point in staying for the credits when the movie is already over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
